    {
      "source": "The implementation accesses the <code>Authentication</code> object provided by Spring Security and looks up the custom <code>UserDetails</code> instance that you have created in your <code>UserDetailsService</code> implementation. We assume here that you are exposing the domain user through the <code>UserDetails</code> implementation but that, based on the <code>Authentication</code> found, you could also look it up from anywhere.",
      "translation": "实现过程会访问 Spring Security 提供的<code>Authentication</code>对象，并从中查找您在<code>UserDetailsService</code>实现中创建的自定义<code>UserDetails</code>实例。在此我们假设您通过<code>UserDetails</code>实现来暴露域用户，但根据找到的<code>Authentication</code>对象，您也可以从任何地方进行查找。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
