    {
      "source": "The time giving instance is provided by a <code>org.springframework.data.auditing.DateTimeProvider</code>.\nBy default this is a <code>CurrentDateTimeProvider</code>.\nThis can be changed via the <code>dateTimeProviderRef</code> attribute when enabling auditing, or a dedicated <code>AuditingHandler</code> or <code>DateTimeProvider</code> bean being present in the <code>ApplicationContext</code>.",
      "translation": "时间实例由 `<code>org.springframework.data.auditing.DateTimeProvider</code>` 提供。默认情况下，这是一个 `<code>CurrentDateTimeProvider</code>`。启用审计功能时，可以通过 `<code>dateTimeProviderRef</code>` 属性进行更改，或者在 `<code>ApplicationContext</code>` 中存在专用的 `<code>AuditingHandler</code>` 或 `<code>DateTimeProvider</code>` Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In case you use either <code>@CreatedBy</code> or <code>@LastModifiedBy</code>, the auditing infrastructure somehow needs to become aware of the current principal. To do so, we provide an <code>AuditorAware&lt;T&gt;</code> SPI interface that you have to implement to tell the infrastructure who the current user or system interacting with the application is. The generic type <code>T</code> defines what type the properties annotated with <code>@CreatedBy</code> or <code>@LastModifiedBy</code> have to be.",
      "translation": "如果您使用了 `<code>@CreatedBy</code>` 或 `<code>@LastModifiedBy</code>`，审计基础设施需要以某种方式感知当前主体。为此，我们提供了一个 `<code>AuditorAware&lt;T&gt;</code>` SPI 接口供您实现，以便告知基础设施当前与应用程序交互的用户或系统是谁。泛型类型 `<code>T</code>` 定义了带有 `<code>@CreatedBy</code>` 或 `<code>@LastModifiedBy</code>` 注解的属性所需的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When using reactive infrastructure you might want to make use of contextual information to provide <code>@CreatedBy</code> or <code>@LastModifiedBy</code> information.\nWe provide an <code>ReactiveAuditorAware&lt;T&gt;</code> SPI interface that you have to implement to tell the infrastructure who the current user or system interacting with the application is. The generic type <code>T</code> defines what type the properties annotated with <code>@CreatedBy</code> or <code>@LastModifiedBy</code> have to be.",
      "translation": "在使用响应式基础设施时，您可能希望利用上下文信息来提供<code>@CreatedBy</code>或<code>@LastModifiedBy</code>信息。我们提供了一个<code>ReactiveAuditorAware&lt;T&gt;</code> SPI 接口，您需要实现该接口以告知基础设施当前与应用程序交互的用户或系统是谁。泛型类型<code>T</code>定义了带有<code>@CreatedBy</code>或<code>@LastModifiedBy</code>注解的属性所需的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "We provide <code>@CreatedBy</code> and <code>@LastModifiedBy</code> to capture the user who created or modified the entity as well as <code>@CreatedDate</code> and <code>@LastModifiedDate</code> to capture when the change happened.",
      "translation": "我们提供 `@CreatedBy` 和 `@LastModifiedBy` 用于记录创建或修改实体的用户，同时提供 `@CreatedDate` 和 `@LastModifiedDate` 用于记录变更发生的时间。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As you can see, the annotations can be applied selectively, depending on which information you want to capture.\nThe annotations, indicating to capture when changes are made, can be used on properties of type JDK8 date and time types, <code>long</code>, <code>Long</code>, and legacy Java <code>Date</code> and <code>Calendar</code>.",
      "translation": "如您所见，注解可根据您希望捕获的信息进行选择性应用。  \n用于在发生更改时触发捕获的注解，可应用于 JDK 8 日期和时间类型的属性、<code>long</code>、<code>Long</code>，以及传统的 Java <code>Date</code> 和 <code>Calendar</code> 类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Applications that only track creation and modification dates are not required to make their entities implement <a href=\"#auditing.auditor-aware\"><code>AuditorAware</code></a>.",
      "translation": "仅跟踪创建和修改日期的应用程序无需使其实体实现<a href=\"#auditing.auditor-aware\"><code>AuditorAware</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In case you do not want to use annotations to define auditing metadata, you can let your domain class implement the <code>Auditable</code> interface. It exposes setter methods for all of the auditing properties.",
      "translation": "如果您不想使用注解来定义审计元数据，可以让您的领域类实现 `<code>Auditable</code>` 接口。该接口提供了所有审计属性的 setter 方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows an implementation of the interface that uses Spring Security’s <code>Authentication</code> object:",
      "translation": "下面的示例展示了如何使用 Spring Security 的 `<code>Authentication</code>` 对象来实现该接口：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows an implementation of the interface that uses reactive Spring Security’s <code>Authentication</code> object:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了如何使用反应式 Spring Security 的 `<code>Authentication</code>` 对象来实现该接口：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data provides sophisticated support to transparently keep track of who created or changed an entity and when the change happened.\nTo benefit from that functionality, you have to equip your entity classes with auditing metadata that can be defined either using annotations or by implementing an interface.\nAdditionally, auditing has to be enabled either through Annotation configuration or XML configuration to register the required infrastructure components.\nPlease refer to the store-specific section for configuration samples.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 提供了复杂的支持功能，能够透明地跟踪实体的创建者或修改者以及变更发生的时间。  \n要利用此功能，您需要在实体类中配置审计元数据，这些元数据可以通过注解定义或通过实现接口来定义。  \n此外，必须通过注解配置或 XML 配置启用审计功能，以注册所需的底层组件。  \n有关配置示例，请参阅特定存储部分的说明。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Auditing metadata does not necessarily need to live in the root level entity but can be added to an embedded one (depending on the actual store in use), as shown in the snippet below.",
      "translation": "审计元数据不一定需要存在于根级实体中，也可以添加到嵌入的实体中（具体取决于实际使用的存储），如下面的代码片段所示。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
